            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.42

- The menu bar icon now matches the new app icon. It was still the old speaker and sound waves. It is now the same three lyric lines with the middle one emphasised, drawn to stay legible at menu bar size and to tint correctly in both light and dark menu bars.
]]></description>
